On My Plate

On My Plate uses only the Python standard library and contains no third-party code, fonts or
images. Python itself is not part of On My Plate; it is installed separately and licensed under the
PSF License Agreement (https://docs.python.org/3/license.html).

Jira and Bitbucket are trademarks of Atlassian, GitLab is a trademark of GitLab Inc. On My Plate
talks only to their documented REST APIs. It is an unofficial, independent community project and
not affiliated with or endorsed by Atlassian or GitLab Inc. All product names, company names and
trademarks mentioned in this project belong to their respective owners and are used only to
describe compatibility.

The task file follows the format of the Obsidian Tasks plugin
(https://github.com/obsidian-tasks-group/obsidian-tasks, MIT License) so both tools can read it.
On My Plate has its own implementation and contains no code of that plugin.

